    <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-4">Classically trained, electronically adopted, a jazz lover at heart. I produce, play trumpet and sing. The music is not a hobby beside the research — it is where most of the research questions came from, and in one case it is the research, written as a song rather than about one.</p>
