        <p class="text-gray-400">Some thirty recordings written for and on the picket line — <em>Check Your Receipt</em>, <em>Clock In, Clock Out (Riot Mix)</em>, <em>Milk for the Monarchy</em>, <em>This Little Wage of Mine</em>. Strike music is a working genre with a job to do: keep a line together long enough for people to talk to each other.</p>
